null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/h6WOpi", "id": "1314781345365110", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974549_1314781348698443_6413088786627952640_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IEYrYShDho4Q7kNvwE1io2m&_nc_oc=AdrrDIopzB1un9XEUxUv_HVO-fhWW7B3dSjnswgguKaDz8Z1VzZgc9pKrrX3lLW6I-Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAHe72_-pR3oM_9K0JKqTZ4i8Zjg_LmBuo-TwdfDS5pAA&oe=6A60B8C0"}, "display_name": "Swords of Gargantua", "keywords": ["action", "coop", "crossplatform", "online", "sword"], "long_description": "SWORDS of GARGANTUA is a cross-platform VR online action game. Fight solo or join up to 3 others in online co-op against a hoard of enemies and their master, the towering titan named GARGANTUA.\n\nKey Features in SWORDS of GARGANTUA:\n\nHyper-Realistic VR Swordsmanship: We\u2019ve taken great care to ensure that each battle feels great through heavy refinement of our battle system and accurate haptic feedback.\n\nCross-Platform 4 Player Co-Op: With native voice chat, develop strategies, revive downed friendlies, and battle hordes of enemies in order to protect your mana station, and penultimately fight an enormous foe.\n\nGrand in Scale: 100 single player missions, 30 weapons to unlock, and a multiplayer mode rarely seen in VR melee action games.\n\nGargantuan in Size: Embrace destiny and take on the mighty titan, Gargantua. Larger and more challenging than anything players have faced in Swords of Gargantua before!", "short_description": "SWORDS of GARGANTUA is a cross-platform VR online action. Fight solo or join up to 3 others in online co-op against a hoard of enemies and their master, the towering titan named GARGANTUA."}]}, "developer_name": "Yomuneco Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.gargantuavr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.gargantuavr.com/eula", "publisher_name": "gumi Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url"